Thought: I have obtained several possible isomers for the molecular formula C12H10O2. To determine the correct SMILES notation, I should compare these isomers with the experimental data, such as NMR spectra. I will start by examining the proton NMR spectra to identify characteristic chemical shifts that can help distinguish between these isomers.
